<title>USA: TENNIS-LIPTON CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-LIPTON CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>KEY BISCYANE, Florida 1997-03-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the $4.45 million Lipton Championships tennis tournament on Sunday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Men's singles, third round</p>
<p>Sergi Bruguera (Spain) beat 3-Michael Chang (U.S.) 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Mark Philippoussis (Australia) beat 9-Wayne Ferreira (South Africa) 6-3 6-3</p>
<p>Andrei Medvedev (Ukraine) beat 11-Albert Costa (Spain) 6-3 3-6 7-6 (7-2)</p>
<p>Gaston Etlis (Argentina) beat Julian Alonso (Spain) 7-6 (7-2) 7-6 (9-7)</p>
<p>Women's singles, third round</p>
<p>1-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) beat Venus Williams (U.S.) 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>2-Arantxa Sanchez Vicario (Spain) beat Henrieta Nagyova (Slovakia) 7-5 4-6 6-4</p>
<p>3-Jana Novotna (Czech Republic) beat Lisa Raymond (U.S.) 6-2 6-1</p>
<p>4-Monica Seles (U.S.) beat Amy Frazier (U.S.) 6-3 6-3</p>
<p>5-Lindsay Davenport (U.S.) beat Magdalena Grzybowski (Poland) 6-2 6-0</p>
<p>Alexandra Fusai (France) beat 6-Anke Huber (Germany) 7-6 (7-1) 6-3</p>
<p>7-Irina Spirlea (Romania) beat Sabine Appelmans (Belgium) 2-6 6-2 6-3</p>
<p>8-Iva Majoli (Croatia) beat Ai Sugiyama (Japan) 6-3 3-6 6-3</p>
<p>10-Mary Joe Fernandez (U.S.) beat Magdalena Maleeva (Bulgaria) 3-6 6-2 6-4</p>
<p>11-Barbara Paulus (Austria) beat Nathalie Tauziat (France) 6-1 6-7 (5-7) 6-1</p>
<p>16-Elena Likhovtseva (Russia) beat Ruxandra Dragomir (Romania) 6-7 (5-7) 6-4 7-5</p>
<p>Anna Kournikova (Russia) beat Katarina Studenikova (Slovakia) 1-6 6-4 6-0</p>
<p>Sandrine Testud (France) beat Tatiana Panova (Russia) 7-6 (7-4) 6-1</p>
<p>Asa Carlsson (Sweden) beat Natasha Zvereva (Belarus) 6-4 1-6 6-1</p>
<p>Barbara Schett (Austria) beat Kimberly Po (U.S.) 6-3 7-5</p>
</text>
